y-id "q-130905" :question/problem "Find the cofactor of ${g}_{42}$ in \n$G=[\\begin{aligned}8 & 0 & 2 & \\sqrt{3} & -2 \\\\ 3 & 5 & 0 & \\sqrt{7} & 1 \\\\ 0 & -8 & -5 & 6 & -4 \\\\ 4 & \\sqrt{5} & 3 & 8 & 3 \\\\ 11 & 3 & 0 & -9 & 11\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "First, to get the minor of ${g}_{42}$, we remove the $4$th row and $2$nd column: \n\n$$\nG=[\\begin{aligned}8 & ∗ & 2 & \\sqrt{3} & -2 \\\\ 3 & ∗ & 0 & \\sqrt{7} & 1 \\\\ 0 & ∗ & -5 & 6 & -4 \\\\ ∗ & \\sqrt{5} & ∗ & ∗ & ∗ \\\\ 11 & ∗ & 0 & -9 & 11\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the minor is \n\n$$\n{M}_{42}=|\\begin{aligned}8 & 2 & \\sqrt{3} & -2 \\\\ 3 & 0 & \\sqrt{7} & 1 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 6 & -4 \\\\ 11 & 0 & -9 & 11\\end{aligned}|.\n$$\n\nNow, the cofactor of ${g}_{42}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{C}_{42} & =(-1)^{4+2}{M}_{42} \\\\  & ={M}_{42} \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}8 & 2 & \\sqrt{3} & -2 \\\\ 3 & 0 & \\sqrt{7} & 1 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 6 & -4 \\\\ 11 & 0 & -9 & 11\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-130905/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "58148550-e41f-5df0-80dc-e783619cf87d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-130905"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-130907/selection/2bb7ffa065cfc6d92708956b383a4f786f17779558cd0f45a9aeea401e392d54" :answer/id #uuid "7a91d6eb-3d5f-5867-a558-d0d1fe74f0aa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}5 & \\sqrt{13} & 0 & 1 \\\\ -1 & -5 & 6 & -4 \\\\ 8 & 3 & 8 & 3 \\\\ 3 & \\sqrt{2} & -9 & 7\\end{aligned}|" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130907/selection/f0b787b02c538a9f0737e9921e6fac2a660d3f60ddf4b8da76ae3360eab83576" :answer/id #uuid "47a0eddd-02fb-5641-8764-d23d98730241" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}3 & -8 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 5 & 0 & 1 \\\\ -25 & -1 & 6 & -4 \\\\ 4 & 8 & 8 & 3\\end{aligned}|" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130907/selection/ff6dab288b3afda2ee3e54