-25 & -1 & -5 & 6 & -4 \\\\ 4 & 8 & 3 & 8 & 3 \\\\ 11 & 3 & \\sqrt{2} & -9 & 7\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "First, to get the minor of ${p}_{35}$, we remove the $3$rd row and $5$th column: \n\n$$\nP=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -8 & 2 & 1 & ∗ \\\\ 3 & 5 & \\sqrt{13} & 0 & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & ∗ & ∗ & ∗ & -4 \\\\ 4 & 8 & 3 & 8 & ∗ \\\\ 11 & 3 & \\sqrt{2} & -9 & ∗\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the minor is \n\n$$\n{M}_{35}=|\\begin{aligned}3 & -8 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 5 & \\sqrt{13} & 0 \\\\ 4 & 8 & 3 & 8 \\\\ 11 & 3 & \\sqrt{2} & -9\\end{aligned}|.\n$$\n\nNow, the cofactor of ${p}_{35}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{C}_{35} & =(-1)^{3+5}{M}_{35} \\\\  & ={M}_{35} \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}3 & -8 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 5 & \\sqrt{13} & 0 \\\\ 4 & 8 & 3 & 8 \\\\ 11 & 3 & \\sqrt{2} & -9\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-130907/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "58148550-e41f-5df0-80dc-e783619cf87d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-130907"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-131096/selection/faf6532f0d4ab903ddc295ac11018acfd3bce2ae030f3f2eed578181eeb5e5e5" :answer/id #uuid "d3d5e303-e169-53f1-af41-e7d2822ac03b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-48" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-131096/selection/abe476e447976564bc5c670fe73789666287b967d49bbed12b1d85144449e63e" :answer/id #uuid "82837abc-9914-5634-a56e-cbcaa750236a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "23" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-131096/selection/363bec1cbe5eb705ac56e1ee31948fd0aba093ca44063ceaa6508a26b0cf84e9" :answer/id #uuid "8f481d6f-8d90-54b7-a5fa-650497b3a7ba" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-125" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-131096/selection/12b7d840a997b0af25896f37c76d366155c72a970c1525c62ec119b69786f393" :answer/id #uuid "baac03c2-5594-5d6d-afe6-d11f2e4af0af" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "13" :db/ensur